{"SHOUT_CAREFUL","reg=raider",{"Stay right where you are! Not one step closer!","We hear you, now back off, slow","Don't come over here, I mean it","Keep your distance, loudmouth!","You're carrying - stay put!","Stop right there! Boys, eyes on this one!","Yell all you want, but come closer and you're done","Easy! Stay out there where we can see you!","Turn around and walk, and nobody gets excited","We ain't looking for company - keep back","I got you in my sights - stay there","Don't be walking up on us, stay back!"}},
{"SHOUT_CAREFUL","reg=raider|world=road",{"Hands where we can see 'em, and stay on that side of the road!"}},
{"SHOUT_CAREFUL","reg=prison",{"Stay back! Stay back, I said!","Don't you come near us! Who sent you?!","Keep away! We don't want nothing to do with you!","Stop right there! You a cop? Stay back!","Back off, {g:man|lady}! I'm jumpy! I'm real jumpy!","Don't come closer! We'll hurt you! Really!","Stay where I can see you! Don't move sideways!","Nuh-uh! Stay over there!","Keep your distance! I don't trust nobody who yells!","Get back! Get back or it gets bad!","Don't come round here! We're not going back!","Freeze! Stay out there!"}},
{"SHOUT_CAREFUL","reg=gang",{"Stay over there! Don't come on the block!","Back up, {g:man|lady}! We see you!","Don't walk up on us! Stay right there!","Keep your distance! I ain't playing!","Yo, stop right there! Close enough!","Nah, don't come over here!","Ay, you strapped? Stay back then!","We don't know you - stay back","Don't get no closer, homie!","Hold up! Don't move! Stay there!","Walk the other way, we ain't friendly today!","Back off! We watching every step!","Don't come round the corner! Stay out there!","Keep them hands visible and your feet still!","You close enough already!","Turn around, {g:man|lady}, nothing for you here!","Don't test us! Stay back!","Easy! Easy! Don't come closer!","Talk from over there if you got something to say!","Hold it! One more step and we got a problem!","Nah, nah, stay there!","This block closed! Back off!","Go on, keep walking! Keep walking!"}},
{"SHOUT_CAREFUL","reg=gang|world=road",{"Stay on your side of the street!"}},
{"SHOUT_CAREFUL","reg=gang|world=building,rooftop",{"Stay put! We got people on the roof!"}},
{"SHOUT_CAREFUL","reg=club",{"That's close enough, friend - stay there","Hold it right there, {g:pal|lady}, we don't know you","Keep your distance from the bikes","Don't come any closer, I'd hate to scuff my boots on you","You can talk from over there","Back up a few steps, friend - humor me","Don't walk up on the club - not smart","Keep your hands where I see 'em and your feet where they are","We ain't open for visitors today","Stay put, we've had a bad week with strangers","Nobody comes within spitting distance - stay back","Hold up, keep that weapon pointed at the dirt","Beat it, there's nothing for you here","Stop, next step's the one that counts","Keep back, that's a polite request, for now","We see you just fine from there - stay put","Don't get any closer to the fire, {g:pal|lady}","Keep your hands off your belt and your feet still","Nobody rides with us uninvited - back off","We're watching you, friend - stay out on the blacktop"}},
{"SHOUT_CAREFUL","reg=club|role=biker_boss",{"Stay where you are, my brothers are nervous today","I'll talk to you - from there"}},
{"SHOUT_CAREFUL","reg=club|tmp=predator",{"Stay back, hoss, or you're gonna get hurt!","Whoa! Right there! Right THERE!"}},
{"SHOUT_CAREFUL","reg=club|world=road",{"Easy, stay out on the road where we can see you"}},
{"SHOUT_CAREFUL","reg=crime",{"Stay where you are, we don't do walk-ins","That's close enough - keep your hands visible","Don't approach, we'll talk from here, if at all","Stop there, my associates don't know you","Keep back, this is a private operation","Nobody comes closer without an invitation","Please stay out there, it's healthier for everyone","Hold it, turn around slowly and show me you're empty","We see you - don't make us see you any closer","Stay back from the still, friend","Distance, please, we've been burned before","You're not on the list - keep back"}},
{"SHOUT_CAREFUL","reg=crime|world=vehicle",{"Don't come near the truck, that's not a suggestion"}},
{"SHOUT_CAREFUL","reg=outlaw",{"Stay there, I'm not in a trusting mood","That's far enough, {g:bud|lady}","Don't come closer, I've been shot at twice this week","Keep your distance and we'll get along fine","I can hear you from there - stay there","Back off, I just don't like people","Stop, I don't know you and I don't want to","Stay out in the open, where I can see you","Don't make me stand up, stay back","Keep walking, stranger - other direction","Stay back, last fella who came close stole my boots"}},
{"SHOUT_CAREFUL","reg=outlaw|world=road",{"Hold it, let's keep some road between us"}},
{"SHOUT_FRIENDLY","reg=raider|world=road",{"Over here, road dog! You're alright by us!"}},
{"SHOUT_FRIENDLY","reg=raider",{"Come on over, we ain't gonna bite, not you, anyway","That you hollering? Get over here and have a drink!","Yeah, we hear you! Come on, you're one of the good ones","Quit yelling and come on over, we got a fire going","Friend of the crew! Over here!","You lost, {g:buddy|lady}? Come on, we'll point you right","Well, look who it is! Get your ass over here!","We're right here! Keep the noise down or you'll bring the dead!","Over here! Careful where you step!","Come on in! Nobody shoots friends - mostly","Hollering like that, you're lucky it's us that heard you","This way! We kept a warm can of beans with your name on it!"}},
{"SHOUT_FRIENDLY","reg=prison",{"Over here! Relax, you're good with us!","Hey! Come here, you're alright, I remember you!","That you? Come on, come on, we got room!","Yeah we hear ya! Get over here before them things do!","Everybody, easy, this one's cool!","Over here! We ain't gonna shank you, promise!","Come on over! First friendly face since we got out!","Yo! This way! Keep low!","Get over here! You play spades? We play spades!","Come on in! Just no sudden moves, we're jumpy!","It's alright! We're friends! Friends! Get over here!"}},
{"SHOUT_FRIENDLY","reg=prison|world=inside",{"Quit shouting and get in here, {g:man|lady}!"}},
{"SHOUT_FRIENDLY","reg=gang",{"Yo! Over here! You good with us!","Ay, that you? Come through, come through!","We hear you, {g:man|lady}! Come on over!","Over here! Don't be shouting like that on the block!","It's cool, it's cool! Come on!","You with us! Get over here!","Yo, what's up! This way!","Come through! We got you!","Keep it down and come on over!","Ayo, it's you! Come on, we was just talking about you!","Relax! Ain't nobody gonna touch you, you with us!","Come on over, we got some cold ones - well - warm ones","Right here! Walk slow so nobody gets jumpy!","What's happening? Get over here!","You looking for us? You found us! Come on!","Over here, over here! We see you!","Don't stand out there with them things around! Come here!","It's all love! Come on over!","You cool with us! Everybody chill!","Keep yelling like that and you'll wake the whole dead neighborhood! Come on!","This way! Watch the glass!","Over here! Come talk to us!","Ayy! Look who made it! Come here!"}},
{"SHOUT_FRIENDLY","reg=gang|world=vehicle",{"Over here by the car! You straight!"}},
{"SHOUT_FRIENDLY","reg=gang|world=stairs",{"Yo, we up here! Take the stairs!"}},
{"SHOUT_FRIENDLY","reg=club",{"Over here, friend! You ride with us today!","That you shouting? Pull on in, we got coffee on the burner","Come on over, any friend of the club eats with us","Easy, brothers, this one's alright, come on in, {g:pal|lady}","Yeah, we hear you! Walk on up, nobody's gonna draw","Over by the bikes! Mind the kickstands!","Well, hell! Get over here and tell us where you've been!","Keep it down and come on up, we're parked behind the feed store","Come on! We got a spare seat and a warm beer!","That voice sounds friendly - get on over here","You made it! Come on, we'll top off your canteen","Right here, {g:pal|lady} - walk slow past the dog, he don't know you yet","Friend! We figured the dead had you - come here!","Pull up a chair, figure of speech, we lost the chairs","Holler heard - come on in before you draw a crowd","We're up by the overpass! Come on!","You look like hell, friend - come get some shade","Come on over! {name}'s cooking, so lower your expectations!"}},
{"SHOUT_FRIENDLY","reg=club|world=road",{"Come on in off the road, friend, too hot to stand out there","Over here! Nobody out on this road but us and the dead!"}},
{"SHOUT_FRIENDLY","reg=club|role=biker_boss",{"You're welcome at our fire - come on over","Brothers, stand down, that's a friend of ours","Let 'em through, this one's square with the club"}},
{"SHOUT_FRIENDLY","reg=club|tmp=predator",{"Hey, hoss! Over here!","Yo! Over here! Bring your thirst!"}},
{"SHOUT_FRIENDLY","reg=crime",{"Over here, you're among friends, relatively speaking","We hear you - come on over, but quietly","Ah, it's you - come in, we were hoping you'd turn up","Come on over, business is good, and so are you","This way - mind the jars, they're full","Friend of the family - come in, come in","Keep it down and come around back","You're welcome here, just don't touch the merchandise","Over here, we'll pour you something that isn't water","Good to hear a voice we trust - come on","Walk on in, nobody here will bother you","Come over and sit, we'll talk terms another day","Right here, you look like you could use a favor"}},
{"SHOUT_FRIENDLY","reg=outlaw",{"Over here, stranger - you're alright","Yeah, I hear you - come set a spell, if you want","Come on, we got coffee, well, hot water that remembers coffee","Over here - quiet, though, my head's killing me","Come on over, ain't much, but it's shade","You made it, figured you would - come here","Over here! Don't go rushing at us, now","Come on, any friend's a friend, and I got precious few","Walk on in, leave the shouting outside","Yeah, yeah, we see you - get over here before you draw a herd","Come on in, I won't rob you, you're too much like me"}},
{"SHOUT_FRIENDLY","reg=outlaw|world=road",{"That you? Good - come on in off the road"}},
