{"SHOUT_HOSTILE","reg=raider",{"Oh, we heard you! Come on over, meat!","Keep yelling! Makes you easier to find!","Over there! Go get it!","You picked the wrong crew to holler at!","Yeah, holler for your mama! She ain't coming!","Found you! Boys, fresh meat!","That's the last noise you're ever gonna make!","You want attention? You got it!","Big mistake, loudmouth!","Hear that, boys? Dinner bell!","Oh, you're dead now!","Scream louder! I like it louder!"}},
{"SHOUT_HOSTILE","reg=raider|world=road",{"Nobody yells on our road! Kill 'em!"}},
{"SHOUT_HOSTILE","reg=prison",{"There they are! Get 'em!","You shouldn't have yelled! Now you're mine!","Guard! It's a guard! Kill 'em!","I heard you! I heard you! I'm coming!","Loud mouth, short life!","You're gonna scream a whole lot more in a minute!","Nobody's locking me up again! Get 'em!","Oh, this one wants trouble! Trouble's here!","Found ya! Hahaha, found ya!","Shut that mouth permanent!","Over there! Rush 'em! Rush 'em!","Twelve years of waiting, and here you are!"}},
{"SHOUT_HOSTILE","reg=gang",{"There! Get 'em!","You yelling on our block?! You done!","Found 'em! Light it up!","Big mouth! Let's go!","Yo, we heard you, now we coming!","Wrong block to be loud on!","Run! Go on, run! We'll catch you!","Ay, they over there! Move, move!","You wanted us? Here we come!","You dead! You hear me? Dead!","Nobody disrespects the block!","Get 'em before they get away!","Keep shouting, we following the sound!","That's them! Go, go, go!","Oh, you asked for it now!","Surround 'em! Don't let 'em out!","You done messed up!","Hollering for help? Ain't nobody coming!","Last mistake you ever make!","Cut 'em off! Don't let 'em reach the corner!","Loud and stupid! Get 'em!","We see you! There's nowhere to go!","Yo, it's on! It's on!","Nobody walks out of here loud!","Come here! Come here!"}},
{"SHOUT_HOSTILE","reg=club",{"Heard you, friend, brothers, mount up!","Somebody's hollering! Let's go say hello!","You shouldn't have made a sound, {g:pal|lady}","Over there! Run 'em down!","That's the one that crossed the club! Get 'em!","Oh, you called us? We're coming","Loud way to die, friend","You wanted company? Company's here!","Circle 'em! Nobody leaves!","Hear that? That's somebody about to be dead","Brothers! Eyes left! Get 'em!","Hollering won't help you - nothing will","Come on out! We'll make it quick!","You got some nerve! Let's see how much!","Flank 'em by the ditch! Go!","Last thing you'll hear is us laughing!","Quit hiding and take it like you mean it!"}},
