{"SHOUT_NEUTRAL","reg=raider",{"Yeah? Who's yelling?","We hear you, state your business","What do you want, spit it out","Somebody's got a big mouth - what?","You yelling at us? Say what you gotta say","We're here - talk","Who's that? Friend or trouble?","Quiet down, genius, what is it?","Yeah, we got ears - what's the holler for?","Speak up, then, we ain't got all day","Loud one, ain't you? Go on","Whatcha want, stranger?","Hollering at a crew like ours, brave or stupid - which?"}},
{"SHOUT_NEUTRAL","reg=prison",{"Who's that? What you want?","Yeah? What? What is it?","We hear you - who are you?","Don't yell, {g:man|lady}! What do you want?","You talking to us? What?","Who's asking? You ain't a guard, are you?","Say it, say what you want","Yeah yeah, we hear you! What?!","What's the noise for? Somebody chasing you?","Speak, and don't lie, I can always tell","Yeah we're here - so what?","Keep talking from over there"}},
{"SHOUT_NEUTRAL","reg=gang",{"Who that? What you want?","Yo, why you yelling?","We hear you - go ahead and talk","What's up? Speak your piece","You calling us? For what?","Who you looking for?","Ay, what's the problem?","Say what you gotta say, {g:man|lady}","You lost or something?","We right here - what?","This our block - what you need?","Hollering at us? Better be important","Who's that making all that noise?","Talk to me - don't walk up, just talk","Aight, you got our attention - now what?","What you want with us?","Somebody yelling - Yo, who is that?","Keep it short, {g:man|lady} - what?","You need something? Ask","Why you out here shouting like that?","What, you selling something?","Alright, what's the word?","Yo, we heard - go on, spit it out","Man, you trying to get us all killed? What?","Hold on, hold on - who's out there?"}},
{"SHOUT_NEUTRAL","reg=club",{"We hear you, friend - what's on your mind?","Who's making all the racket?","Go ahead and say your piece from there","Yeah? Talk to me","What'll it be, {g:pal|lady}?","You yelling for us or at us?","We're listening - don't dawdle","Who's out there? Name and business","Holler's heard - now what?","What do you need, stranger?","We got ears - what's the story?","You looking for someone in particular?","Easy, tell us what you want","Something we can do for you?","Quit yelling, just say what you want","Somebody's lost - what you after?","Yeah, we're here - what's got you hollering?","Speak your mind, friend, then we'll see","Alright, we heard you - and?","You selling, buying or begging?"}},
