{"SHOUT_NEUTRAL","reg=outlaw",{"What?","Yeah, I heard - what do you want?","Go on, say it, I'm too tired to guess","Who's that hollering? Speak up","You need something, or you just like yelling?","Talk, I'll listen for about a minute","What's the trouble?","We ain't looking for company, but go ahead","Somebody's loud - well?","If it's about the Army coming, I don't want to hear it","Say your piece, then move along","Yeah, we're here - Lord knows why - what?"}},
